From 6c776e97ab0e14a49a0e9ababfbdc6b569f2b97a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: danhancach <111163507+danhancach@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:02:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] audio: Restrict portrait mono to built-in speaker outputs

Combine the dedicated request with accessibility mono per output. Blend DIRECT
PCM, including packed 24-bit samples, without modifying haptic channels. Keep
external outputs eligible for offload/MMAP and require supported PCM fallback
on the speaker while portrait mono is active.

Related:
- device/sony/pdx237/patchs/frameworks/av/0005-speaker-portrait-mono.patch
- hardware/sony: SoundEnhancement Speaker mono preference and Quick Settings tile
- vendor/sony/audio: stop daxService from writing accessibility master_mono
